sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Internet user
  participant CF as Cloudflare
  participant Tunnel as Cloudflare Tunnel
  participant C as cloudflared
  participant N as reverse-nginx
  participant S as Public service

  User->>CF: Request blog.yuuyan.top
  CF->>Tunnel: Route public hostname
  Tunnel->>C: Forward through tunnel
  C->>N: HTTP request inside proxy network
  N->>S: proxy_pass by server_name/path
  S-->>N: Response
  N-->>C: Response
  C-->>CF: Response
  CF-->>User: HTTPS response
